                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 84, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 22px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 52, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, width: 1060 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>两栏四行一一对应，但不表示执行顺序</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>本章示例尚处于设计准备，只完成了左侧这一栏所要求的材料。</Text>
